001134r 2               ;   V A R I A B L E S ,   A R R A Y S ,   S T R I N G   H E A P
001134r 2               ;
001134r 2               ;   Inline-ported from msbasic-master/{var,array,string,memory}.s and
001134r 2               ;   misc2.s (GivAyf/SngFlt).  All MSBASIC externals are resolved here:
001134r 2               ;
001134r 2               ;     SynErr / MemErr / IqErr / Gme / SubErr        - error trampolines
001134r 2               ;     ChkCom / ChkCls / ChkNum / ChkStr             - parser predicates
001134r 2               ;     MakInt / FrmNum / FrmEvl                      - minimal stubs (only
001134r 2               ;                                                     handle literal unsigned
001134r 2               ;                                                     decimals via Fin; full
001134r 2               ;                                                     evaluator wired in a
001134r 2               ;                                                     later phase)
001134r 2               ;     IsLetC                                        - ASCII letter test
001134r 2               ;     PtrGet / Array / GetAry                       - variable lookup
001134r 2               ;     StrIni / StrSpa / GetSpa / PutNew / MovStr    - string allocation
001134r 2               ;     Garbag (and helpers)                          - string GC
001134r 2               ;     Bltu / Reason                                 - block-up-move helpers
001134r 2               ;     AyInt / GivAyf / SngFlt                       - FP <-> 16-bit int
001134r 2               ;     BasCmdClr                                     - implements CLR / NEW core
001134r 2               ; =============================================================================
