0011FEr 2               ; Reason -- Verify (Y,A) <= FRETOP, calling Garbag and rechecking on
0011FEr 2               ; failure.  We omit the msbasic save/restore of TEMP1..FAC-1 because in
0011FEr 2               ; our layout TEMP1 is above FAC; Garbag only writes to its own ZP scratch
0011FEr 2               ; (FNCNAM/Z52/HIGHDS/HIGHTR/INDEX/LOWTR/DSCLEN) so callers that have FAC
0011FEr 2               ; live across Reason must save FAC themselves.  Current callers do.
0011FEr 2               Reason:
0011FEr 2  CC 66 03             cpy     FRETOP+1
001201r 2  90 1C                bcc     @ok
001203r 2  D0 05                bne     @gc
001205r 2  CD 65 03             cmp     FRETOP
001208r 2  90 15                bcc     @ok
00120Ar 2               @gc:
00120Ar 2  48                   pha
00120Br 2  98                   tya
00120Cr 2  48                   pha
00120Dr 2  20 rr rr             jsr     Garbag
001210r 2  68                   pla
001211r 2  A8                   tay
001212r 2  68                   pla
001213r 2  CC 66 03             cpy     FRETOP+1
001216r 2  90 07                bcc     @ok
001218r 2  D0 06                bne     @oom
00121Ar 2  CD 65 03             cmp     FRETOP
00121Dr 2  B0 01                bcs     @oom
00121Fr 2               @ok:
00121Fr 2  60                   rts
001220r 2               @oom:
001220r 2  4C rr rr             jmp     MemErr
