002ACBr 2               ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
002ACBr 2               ; Token-address dispatch table.  Indexed by (token - $80).  Each entry is
002ACBr 2               ; (routine_address - 1) since the dispatcher PHA-pushes it and uses the
002ACBr 2               ; "JMP ChrGet -> RTS" trick to enter.
